    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d29">

                <pb facs="0124" n="878" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg878"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5133</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-14T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 14, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4995. Your June 5, 2 p.m., 6357. Nothing definitely decided in regard to
                    permanent technical mission. Considering advisability of nominating
                    representatives for committees already established. Decision will be reached
                    shortly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
